      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapOperation on the recalculateDistances() call in each of TeslaNetwork's six mutation methods: marks the network dirty (an @Unique field) instead; the network's own recalculateDistances() then runs once, at HEAD of the next distance read (AbstractTeslaBlockEntity.getDistance, saveAdditional, getUpdateTag), of the next outgoing-set change outside the network (addOutgoing, removeOutgoing, load), of TeslaNetwork.clearAll, and before a block entity leaves the network (HEAD of unregisterBlockEntity; HEAD of registerBlockEntity when another block entity sits at that position), so the one that leaves keeps the distance of the rebuild before it left, as with the rebuild at every mutation; the network is looked up in TeslaNetwork.NETWORKS (handed to the helper by an @Inject at the TAIL of TeslaNetwork's static initializer; never created). Runtime flag companionsTeslaLazyDistances. Helpers bons.furious.patch.companions_coo49.TeslaDistances, LazyTeslaNetwork.",
      "license": "Companions (GPL-3.0): no Companions code is carried; the hooks call its own recalculateDistances"
